#### Population and seascape genomics of the whitespotted (_Rhynchobatus djiddensis_)  and bottlenose (_R. australiae_) wedgefishes (Part I) ###

### Overview ###
# This repository contains QC, de novo assembly and filtering scripts used to process raw 3RADseq data generated using the NovaSeq S4 high-throughput sequencing (HTS) platforms with paired end (PE) sequencing (2 × 150 bp). PBS and R scripts are in [brackets]. Our pipeline consists of the following steps:

